<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firmer on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firmer on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee firmed against both the dollar and the pound on Wednesday, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 20.5915 against the dollar from 20.6015 on Monday. Against the pound, the rupee was fixed at a mean of 32.0305 from 32.0505 on Monday.</p>
<p>Tuesday was a public holiday in Mauritius.</p>
